# UX workflow: Pattern Preset folder creation and navigation.
# Purpose: proves the typed User hierarchy, shared text keyboard, folder
# entry, one-level Back grammar, and the dedicated folder icons at 320x240.
# Expect: capture_changed:pattern_folder_save_list=pattern_folder_keyboard, capture_changed:pattern_folder_keyboard=pattern_folder_created, capture_changed:pattern_folder_created=pattern_folder_parent

0 scenario sequencer

# Enter Pattern Editor and open its Pattern Preset library.
100 tap NAV 60
300 button NAV down
1400 tick
1450 button NAV up

# Switch Load -> Save, focus New Folder and open the common text keyboard.
1650 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
1850 encoder NAV 1
2000 capture screen pattern_folder_save_list
2100 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
2300 capture screen pattern_folder_keyboard

# Enter a minimal valid folder name, create it, and enter it immediately.
2400 tap NAV 60
2550 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
2850 capture screen pattern_folder_created

# LEFT_TOP backs out exactly one hierarchy level before closing the library.
3000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3250 capture screen pattern_folder_parent
3400 tap LEFT_TOP 60
